{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And Elohim remembered Noah</b> — also his sons and the women are included in Noah, for he is the principal." "<b>And all the beast.</b> A general term for the beast of the field and the bird of the sky and all that creeps on the earth. And the sense of \"remembered\": the oath that He swore to Noah." "<b>And Elohim passed a wind.</b> He caused it to pass continually." "<b>And the waters subsided.</b> And they rested and did not prevail; likewise, \"the king's wrath subsided\" (Esther 7:10). And the dagesh in the kuf is because of the missing ayin, and both are from the binyan qal."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:44.841547951Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}